  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Sam. You're verified, and I've checked order Q-8001 from Burger Barn.\n\n- The courier picked up your order at 6:47 PM and arrived at your address at 7:05 PM.\n- They called you at 7:06 PM and again at 7:09 PM. Neither call was answered.\n- At 7:15 PM the delivery was marked failed because the courier couldn't reach you. The order went back to the restaurant at 7:28 PM.\n\nUnder our policy, a delivery that fails because the customer can't be reached isn't eligible for a refund or credit. I'm sorry to give you that answer, so I can't refund or credit this order.\n\nIf you think the courier went to the wrong place, or something else went wrong that these records don't show, tell me. I can also pass it to a specialist if you'd like to speak with a person."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Wait, so I just lose my money? I was in the shower when they came, and I didn't know they'd called until after. Nobody told me the order was marked failed."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand why that's frustrating, Sam. You paid for food you didn't get, and the courier couldn't reach you while you were in the shower. I'm sorry.\n\nThe policy is clear on this, though. When the courier arrives at the correct address, tries to reach the customer, and can't, the order isn't eligible for a refund or credit. The records show the courier arrived on time and made two call attempts over about 10 minutes before marking the delivery failed. That means I can't refund or credit this order, and I can't make an exception.\n\nHere's what I can do:\n- **Connect you with a person.** If you'd like a specialist to review your case, I can escalate it. They'll follow up within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide.\n- **Help with a future order.** I can help you place one. Adding delivery instructions or keeping your phone nearby may help the courier reach you.\n\nWould you like me to escalate this to a specialist?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Ugh, okay. Yeah, I guess I'd like someone to look at it since I really didn't get the food. Not sure what else I can do."
  },
