   "text": "I've escalated your case to a specialist, Sam. The reference is ESC-700. They'll follow up within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide, but they'll have the full details, including that you were unavailable when the courier called and weren't told the delivery had failed.\n\nI'm sorry this happened. Is there anything else I can help with?"
